        },
        {
            "title": "卧安機器人開始按H股激勵計畫購H股 料斥資總額不逾5億元",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">卧安機器人(06600)公布，已開始根據2026年H股激勵計畫在市場購入公司H股，已動用約3,990萬元，預期整個計畫斥資總額不超過5億元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"卧安機器人官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/OneRobotics-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"卧安機器人官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/OneRobotics-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">卧安機器人官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">該公司披露，剛在8月28日至9月14日期間，根據上述計畫購入10.12萬股，每股作價39.48元至53元，總代價約500萬元；連同之前披露購入的55.2萬股，至今累計共購65.32萬股，涉資約3,990萬元。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766841-%e5%8d%a7%e5%ae%89%e6%a9%9f%e5%99%a8%e4%ba%ba%e9%96%8b%e5%a7%8b%e6%8c%89h%e8%82%a1%e6%bf%80%e5%8b%b5%e8%a8%88%e7%95%ab%e8%b3%bch%e8%82%a1-%e6%96%99%e6%96%a5%e8%b3%87%e7%b8%bd%e9%a1%8d%e4%b8%8d",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/06600.jpg.webp",
